# Secrets / env — monorepo root `.env` only (never commit)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env

# Google Cloud service-account / OAuth client JSON (never copy into this repo)
**/*service-account*.json
**/client_secret*.json
**/secrets/*.json

